    {
      "v": "If while cleaning up the remains of Humpty Dumpty, all the king’s horses and all the king’s men got covered in his “albumen,” what might they later ask their dry cleaner?",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "tQ1"
    },
    {
      "v": "Nourriture ",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "tSubject"
    },
    {
      "v": "2,0,3,1 ",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "tMCOrder"
    },
    {
      "v": "\"Pouvez-vous retirer la COQUILLE D'OEUF des bonnets à plumes ?\" ",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "tW3"
    },
    {
      "v": "Voici un œuf sur votre pantalon ",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "tCat"
    },
    {
      "v": "« Pouvez-vous extraire des BLANCS D’ŒUFS de chemises en coton gonflées ? » ",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "tRight"
    },
    {
      "v": "« Pouvez-vous retirer du SANG du crin de cheval ? » ",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "tW1"
    },
    {
      "v": "S+0.00 ",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "$aQuestion$cQ1"
    },
    {
      "v": "\"Pouvez-vous retirer du JAUNE D'OEUF des collants en soie?\" ",
      "t": "S",
      "n": "tW2"
    },
    {
